    aS "Sooo... {w=0.5}De repente tengo asuntos urgentes en otro lugar."

# game/Story02.rpy:3564

translate spanish akt2chapter6_29af4b1e:

    # aS "See you later, sweetheart."
    aS "Nos vemos luego, cariño."

# game/Story02.rpy:3568

translate spanish akt2chapter6_2ea3673f:

    # em "Where do you think you’re going?"
    em "¿A dónde crees que vas?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3569

translate spanish akt2chapter6_accbefca:

    # em "You’re staying right here."
    em "Te quedas aquí."

# game/Story02.rpy:3570

translate spanish akt2chapter6_ff471631:

    # em "And you’re coming with me."
    em "Y tú vienes conmigo."

# game/Story02.rpy:3572

translate spanish akt2chapter6_051ebaa7:

    # aS "(Whispering) Welp… {w=0.5}Guess I’m screwed."
    aS "(Susurrando) Ayuda... {w=0.5}Supongo que estoy jodido."

# game/Story02.rpy:3574

translate spanish akt2chapter6_2216749f:

    # aS "(What do I do now? I need to slip out of here quietly without anyone noticing.)"
    aS "(¿Qué hago ahora? Necesito salir de aquí tranquilamente sin que nadie se note.)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3575

translate spanish akt2chapter6_8416ed0b:

    # aS "(But how...?)"
    aS "(Pero cómo...?)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3578

translate spanish akt2chapter6_a3895d8c:

    # k "Bad idea, and you know it."
    k "Mala idea, y lo sabes."

# game/Story02.rpy:3579

translate spanish akt2chapter6_76cef165:

    # k "But honestly? I’m surprised. {w=0.5}We already wrote you off, but she… {w=0.5}She’s actually cutting you slack."
    k "Pero honestamente? Estoy sorprendido. {w=0.5}Ya te hemos escrito, pero ella... {w=0.5}Ella te está cortando la pata."

# game/Story02.rpy:3581

translate spanish akt2chapter6_e4255d24:

    # k "Guess you mean more to her than you let on, huh?"
    k "Supongo que quieres decir más con ella de lo que dejaste, ¿eh?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3583

translate spanish akt2chapter6_e2e1ab60:

    # aS "What a nerve-wracking ability you have... {w=0.5}But yes... {w=0.5}She treats not only me this way."
    aS "Qué habilidad desgarradora tienes... {w=0.5}Pero sí... {w=0.5}Ella no solo me trata así."

# game/Story02.rpy:3584

translate spanish akt2chapter6_d1aa6adc:

    # aS "She cares about all her subordinates."
    aS "Se preocupa por todos sus subordinados."

# game/Story02.rpy:3586

translate spanish akt2chapter6_d6c4e940:

    # k "Didn’t save Ivy, though, did it?"
    k "No salvó a Ivy, sin embargo, ¿verdad?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3588

translate spanish akt2chapter6_077dea0f:

    # aS "That was different. {w=0.5}They paid for their mistakes."
    aS "Eso fue diferente. {w=0.5}Pagaron por sus errores."

# game/Story02.rpy:3589

translate spanish akt2chapter6_e4b6691e:

    # aS "But you… You holding up?"
    aS "Pero tú... ¿te estás aferrando?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3591

translate spanish akt2chapter6_0ee12a3b:

    # k "I don’t dwell on the past."
    k "No moro en el pasado."

# game/Story02.rpy:3593

translate spanish akt2chapter6_97808aeb:

    # k "And he’s not him. {w=0.5}He couldn’t have survived. {w=0.5}I know that."
    k "Y no es él. {w=0.5}No pudo sobrevivir. {w=0.5}Lo sé."

# game/Story02.rpy:3595

translate spanish akt2chapter6_20bfe715:

    # k "(...Right?)"
    k "(...¿Verdad?)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3598

translate spanish akt2chapter6_b4e8ab40:

    # h "You know what pisses me off?"
    h "¿Sabes lo que me molesta?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3599

translate spanish akt2chapter6_5acbd9ed:

    # h "People are dying by the thousands up there, and we’re sitting here doing fuck-all."
    h "La gente está muriendo por los miles de ahí arriba, y estamos sentados aquí haciendo mierda-todos."

# game/Story02.rpy:3600

translate spanish akt2chapter6_ad0f4722:

    # h "What the hell are we even waiting for?"
    h "¿Qué demonios estamos esperando?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3603

translate spanish akt2chapter6_69ed20e0:

    # Mi "The diary decryption."
    Mi "El desciframiento diario."

# game/Story02.rpy:3606

translate spanish akt2chapter6_400dde18:

    # k "Our little princess can't wait to die, huh?"
    k "Nuestra pequeña princesa se está muriendo, ¿no?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3608

translate spanish akt2chapter6_53f569b4:

    # h "You wouldn’t believe it, I’m just burning with excitement. Like I’ve got nothing better to do with my time."
    h "No lo creerías, solo estoy quemando con emoción. Como si no tuviera nada mejor que ver con mi tiempo."

# game/Story02.rpy:3611

translate spanish akt2chapter6_75ff49c9:

    # h "But don’t worry, at this rate, we’ll all be dead together if we just keep sitting around."
    h "Pero no te preocupes, a este ritmo, todos estaremos muertos juntos si seguimos sentados."

# game/Story02.rpy:3614

translate spanish akt2chapter6_9b8092a9:

    # mc "You’re being kinda grim about it. Where’s your fighting spirit?"
    mc "Estás siendo un poco sombrío con eso. ¿Dónde está tu espíritu de lucha?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3617

translate spanish akt2chapter6_6249a495:

    # h "Died. Right along with any hope we had. Speaking of which—where the hell is our beloved Astoria?"
    h "Muerte. ¿Con toda esperanza que teníamos? Hablando de eso, ¿dónde diablos está nuestra querida Astoria?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3618

translate spanish akt2chapter6_8e6db950:

    # h "Don’t tell me she’s one of those who bolt when things get tough?"
    h "¿No me digas que es una de esas que se atornillan cuando las cosas se ponen difíciles?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3621

translate spanish akt2chapter6_67eb4bd0:

    # k "What the hell did you just say?! HOW DARE YOU—"
    k "¿Qué demonios acabas de decir?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3623

translate spanish akt2chapter6_89deae69:

    # em "As much as I hate to admit it, she’s got a point. Astoria was nowhere to be seen during the fight. It’s like she vanished into thin air."
    em "Por mucho que odio admitirlo, ella tiene un punto. Astoria no fue a ninguna parte a ser vista durante la lucha. Es como si ella se desvaneciera en el aire delgado."

# game/Story02.rpy:3624

translate spanish akt2chapter6_53883f9b:

    # em "Left her people behind, abandoned them. If she didn’t run off completely."
    em "Dejó a su gente atrás, los abandonó. Si no se escapó por completo."

# game/Story02.rpy:3626

translate spanish akt2chapter6_93a8fd3e:

    # em "Which, if you ask me, makes her a pretty lousy leader."
    em "Lo cual, si me lo preguntas, la convierte en una líder bastante mala."

# game/Story02.rpy:3628

translate spanish akt2chapter6_25b16d9f:

    # em "I get it, you’re all attached to her. But facts are facts—her time is long gone."
    em "Lo entiendo, todos están apegados a ella. Pero los hechos son hechos—su tiempo se ha ido."

# game/Story02.rpy:3630

translate spanish akt2chapter6_da3fdbf1_1:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "..."

# game/Story02.rpy:3631

translate spanish akt2chapter6_b3da750c:

    # Mi "No comment."
    Mi "Sin comentarios."

# game/Story02.rpy:3633

translate spanish akt2chapter6_22947e3b:

    # Fl "Alright, alright, last thing we need is you guys tearing each other apart."
    Fl "Muy bien, muy bien, lo último que necesitamos es que se destrocen entre ustedes."

# game/Story02.rpy:3635

translate spanish akt2chapter6_a3a6f375:

    # Mi "If you’d taken any longer, I’d be giving this report to corpses."
    Mi "Si hubieras tomado más tiempo, estaría dando este informe a los cadáveres."

# game/Story02.rpy:3637

translate spanish akt2chapter6_184619bd:

    # Fl "Yeah, yeah, I know. But the job’s not done yet."
    Fl "Sí, sí, lo sé, pero el trabajo aún no ha terminado."

# game/Story02.rpy:3640

translate spanish akt2chapter6_42b9b019:

    # k "Oh, you’ve got to be kidding me…"
    k "Tienes que estar bromeando..."

# game/Story02.rpy:3642

translate spanish akt2chapter6_4d2f7916:

    # Fl "I’ve almost cracked the protocol you gave me. Another hour, tops, and I’ll have the final results."
    Fl "Casi he roto el protocolo que me diste. Otra hora, arriba, y tendré los resultados finales."

# game/Story02.rpy:3644

translate spanish akt2chapter6_48bedf22:

    # Fl "And let’s be real, nobody else here could pull it off, so you better be grateful."
    Fl "Y seamos reales, nadie más aquí podría sacarlo, así que mejor que estés agradecido."

# game/Story02.rpy:3646

translate spanish akt2chapter6_6e5f3517:

    # aS "Then why the hell did you call us all here? {w=0.5}What’s the logic in that?"
    aS "¿Entonces por qué demonios nos llamaste a todos aquí? {w=0.5}¿Cuál es la lógica en eso?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3648

translate spanish akt2chapter6_a4e26a27:

    # Fl "The soldiers? {w=0.5}Gone. {w=0.5}Ammunition? {w=0.5}Empty."
    Fl "¿Los soldados? {w=0.5}Se fue. {w=0.5}¿Municiones? {w=0.5}Vacía."

# game/Story02.rpy:3649

translate spanish akt2chapter6_4d0ed194:

    # Fl "Enemies? Pouring in like waves."
    Fl "Enemigos, en forma de olas."

# game/Story02.rpy:3650

translate spanish akt2chapter6_54cf80be:

    # Fl "Eastern front? Gone. {w=0.5}South and west are holding, but not for long."
    Fl "¿En el frente oriental? {w=0.5}Sur y oeste están retenidos, pero no por mucho tiempo."

# game/Story02.rpy:3651

translate spanish akt2chapter6_23885ca2:

    # Fl "North is the only buffer zone."
    Fl "El norte es la única zona de amortiguación."

# game/Story02.rpy:3652

translate spanish akt2chapter6_0810e1cb:

    # Fl "That enough for you? Or should I go on?"
    Fl "¿O debería seguir?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3654

translate spanish akt2chapter6_3d7fde0e:

    # aS "Yeah, keep going, because I still don’t see why we should give a damn."
    aS "Sí, sigue adelante, porque todavía no veo por qué deberíamos dar un bledo."

# game/Story02.rpy:3655

translate spanish akt2chapter6_c7ccd612:

    # aS "Besides Ember, no one here can turn the tide of this war."
    aS "Además de Ember, nadie puede dar vuelta a la marea de esta guerra."

# game/Story02.rpy:3657

translate spanish akt2chapter6_69f7d750:

    # aS "{b}No offense, pretty boy.{/b}"
    aS "{b}Sin ofender, chico bonito.{/b}"

# game/Story02.rpy:3659

translate spanish akt2chapter6_18a6485a:

    # mc "None taken. {w=0.5}Honestly."
    mc "No se ha tomado nada. {w=0.5}Sinceramente."

# game/Story02.rpy:3661

translate spanish akt2chapter6_47a761da:

    # Fl "I wouldn’t be so sure. {w=0.5}There are two more people in this room who could change the course of this battle."
    Fl "No estaría tan seguro. {w=0.5}Hay dos personas más en esta sala que podrían cambiar el curso de esta batalla."

# game/Story02.rpy:3663

translate spanish akt2chapter6_065329d1:

    # k "How touching. {w=0.5}You finally remembered us… {w=0.5}Right when you needed us."
    k "Qué conmovedor. {w=0.5}Finalmente nos recordaste... {w=0.5}Justo cuando nos necesitabas."

# game/Story02.rpy:3664

translate spanish akt2chapter6_18440461:

    # k "Cynical as ever."
    k "Cínico como siempre."

# game/Story02.rpy:3667

translate spanish akt2chapter6_583d6f31:

    # mc "But if I remember correctly… {w=0.5}The enemy’s three million strong."
    mc "Pero si recuerdo correctamente... {w=0.5}El enemigo tiene tres millones de fuertes."

# game/Story02.rpy:3670

translate spanish akt2chapter6_ce74c7ef:

    # mc "How exactly do you plan on stopping them? Killing them all?"
    mc "¿Cómo planeas detenerlos?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3672

translate spanish akt2chapter6_5c4dd855:

    # Fl "Who said anything about killing?"
    Fl "¿Quién dijo algo sobre matar?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3674

translate spanish akt2chapter6_a297f274:

    # em "This lunatic… {w=0.5}wants to freeze half the city."
    em "Este lunático... {w=0.5}Quiere congelar la mitad de la ciudad."

# game/Story02.rpy:3676

translate spanish akt2chapter6_e3b63fea:

    # h "Wait… {w=0.5}You mean cover everything in ice? {w=0.5}Turn the enemy into icicles?"
    h "Espera... {w=0.5}¿Quieres decir cubrir todo en hielo? {w=0.5}¿Convertir al enemigo en los iciclos?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3678

translate spanish akt2chapter6_7b9a19ae:

    # em "Exactly."
    em "Exactamente."

# game/Story02.rpy:3680

translate spanish akt2chapter6_56fc74fd:

    # aS "How the hell are you even planning to pull off {b}something like that{/b}?"
    aS "¿Cómo diablos estás planeando parar? {b}algo así{/b}?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3682

translate spanish akt2chapter6_6c7312f6:

    # Fl "Ever heard of {b}cryogen{/b}?"
    Fl "Nunca oí hablar de {b}cryogen{/b}?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3683

translate spanish akt2chapter6_95fa7f11:

    # Fl "We’re going to {b}flood{/b} the streets with it."
    Fl "Vamos a ir {b}inundaciones{/b} las calles con él."

# game/Story02.rpy:3685

translate spanish akt2chapter6_cac15b7f:

    # Mi "No."
    Mi "No."

# game/Story02.rpy:3686

translate spanish akt2chapter6_ad55d73b:

    # Mi "{b}No.{/b} {w}That’s not happening."
    Mi "{b}No.{/b} {w}Eso no está pasando."

# game/Story02.rpy:3688

translate spanish akt2chapter6_b863b81e:

    # Fl "And why’s that?"
    Fl "¿Y por qué es eso?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3690

translate spanish akt2chapter6_bd592eb5:

    # Mi "Because {b}that will kill every innocent person in the Lower City.{/b}"
    Mi "Porque... {b}que matará a toda persona inocente en la Ciudad Baja.{/b}"

# game/Story02.rpy:3692

translate spanish akt2chapter6_ede41beb:

    # Fl "Since when do you {b}care{/b} about them, Mi?"
    Fl "Desde cuando lo haces {b}cuidado{/b} ¿sobre ellos, Mi?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3694

translate spanish akt2chapter6_989f007f:

    # Mi "Always."
    Mi "Siempre."

# game/Story02.rpy:3696

translate spanish akt2chapter6_eaeb1654:

    # Fl "Don’t worry… {w=0.5}When that {b}horde{/b} gets here, you can just ask them to {b}spare the innocents{/b}."
    Fl "No te preocupes... {w=0.5}Cuando eso {b}horda{/b} llega aquí, puedes pedirles que {b}perdonar a los inocentes{/b}."

# game/Story02.rpy:3697

translate spanish akt2chapter6_a84e08f2:

    # Fl "I thought you’d already {b}accepted reality{/b}."
    Fl "Pensé que ya lo habías hecho. {b}realidad aceptada{/b}."

# game/Story02.rpy:3698

translate spanish akt2chapter6_2c9e049f:

    # Fl "What changed, Mi?"
    Fl "¿Qué cambió, Mi?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3700

translate spanish akt2chapter6_acb43476:

    # Fl "You think I like saying this?"
    Fl "¿Crees que me gusta decir esto?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3701

translate spanish akt2chapter6_97cd9694:

    # Fl "But unlike you, I don’t have the luxury of pouting over it."
    Fl "Pero a diferencia de ti, no tengo el lujo de hacer pis por él."

# game/Story02.rpy:3702

translate spanish akt2chapter6_7c1c0174:

    # Fl "Millions of lives don’t rest on your decisions, Mi. {w=0.5}So suck it up."
    Fl "Millones de vidas no descansan en sus decisiones, Mi. {w=0.5}Así que púdrete."

# game/Story02.rpy:3705

translate spanish akt2chapter6_da3fdbf1_2:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "..."

# game/Story02.rpy:3707

translate spanish akt2chapter6_ed40e6d4:

    # Fl "Well, since no one’s objecting anymore…"
    Fl "Bueno, ya que nadie está objetando más..."

# game/Story02.rpy:3708

translate spanish akt2chapter6_bd4b1786:

    # Fl "I’ll need your full attention now."
    Fl "Necesito tu atención."

# game/Story02.rpy:3711

translate spanish akt2chapter6_b515b38c:

    # Fl "I didn’t wait for your approval. I already sent the peacekeepers to key locations."
    Fl "No esperé su aprobación. Ya envié a los efectivos de mantenimiento de la paz a lugares clave."

# game/Story02.rpy:3712

translate spanish akt2chapter6_7875112f:

    # Fl "They managed to break through the hordes and got the gas flowing through the pipelines."
    Fl "Ellos lograron romper las hordas y lograron que el gas fluya por los oleoductos."

# game/Story02.rpy:3714

translate spanish akt2chapter6_8fa88b00:

    # Fl "But there’s a problem. {w=0.5}Evacuations are still happening in those sectors."
    Fl "Pero hay un problema. {w=0.5}Las evacuaciones siguen ocurriendo en esos sectores."

# game/Story02.rpy:3715

translate spanish akt2chapter6_7a401057:

    # Fl "They won’t hold out long enough."
    Fl "No aguantarán lo suficiente."

# game/Story02.rpy:3718

translate spanish akt2chapter6_1e10fbc2:

    # k "Oh, so you do care about innocent lives, after all?"
    k "¿Te importan las vidas inocentes, después de todo?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3720

translate spanish akt2chapter6_dd7c4ddb:

    # Fl "Who knows? {w=0.5}You tell me."
    Fl "¿Quién sabe? {w=0.5}Dímelo tú."

# game/Story02.rpy:3723

translate spanish akt2chapter6_7ab6f7bc:

    # Fl "But in other areas, the situation is {b}much worse.{/b}"
    Fl "Pero en otras áreas, la situación es {b}mucho peor.{/b}"

# game/Story02.rpy:3725

translate spanish akt2chapter6_8c98f717:

    # Fl "The team sent to the east… {w=0.5}never checked in."
    Fl "El equipo envió al este... {w=0.5}Nunca me comprobé."

# game/Story02.rpy:3727

translate spanish akt2chapter6_fc4cf5fb:

    # Fl "Hate to say it, but they’re probably gone."
    Fl "Odio decirlo, pero probablemente se han ido."

# game/Story02.rpy:3728

translate spanish akt2chapter6_bb4c7f07:

    # Fl "And if we don’t start freezing right now, whatever got to them will get to us next."
    Fl "Y si no empezamos a congelar ahora mismo, lo que les haya llegado a ellos nos llegará a nosotros."

# game/Story02.rpy:3731

translate spanish akt2chapter6_16eeff3f:

    # gggg "Pick up the pace, we don’t have all day."
    gggg "Recoge el ritmo, no tenemos todo el día."

# game/Story02.rpy:3733

translate spanish akt2chapter6_0082978f:

    # g "Commander… Your sacrifice won’t be in vain."
    g "Comandante... su sacrificio no será en vano."

# game/Story02.rpy:3734

translate spanish akt2chapter6_15988fa8:

    # gggg "Don’t just stand there, we need to move!"
    gggg "¡No te quedes ahí parado, tenemos que movernos!"

# game/Story02.rpy:3736

translate spanish akt2chapter6_eebba2e7:

    # g "Yeah."
    g "Sí."

# game/Story02.rpy:3741

translate spanish akt2chapter6_b3f6d948:

    # Fl "That’s where we’re at."
    Fl "Ahí es donde estamos."

# game/Story02.rpy:3743

translate spanish akt2chapter6_1b2e52cc:

    # Fl "Alright, Ashly, Kalesta."
    Fl "Muy bien, Ashly, Kalesta."

# game/Story02.rpy:3744

translate spanish akt2chapter6_98fda854:

    # Fl "I need you two to hold off the monsters in the designated sectors."
    Fl "Necesito que os detengan a los monstruos en los sectores designados."

# game/Story02.rpy:3746

translate spanish akt2chapter6_e57c4dc4:

    # aS "Oh, no, I was gonna go see Rey with the lady. {w=0.5}So Kalesta’s on her own."
    aS "No, iba a ir a ver a Rey con la señora. {w=0.5}Así que Kalesta está sola."

# game/Story02.rpy:3748

translate spanish akt2chapter6_644978d1:

    # em "Don’t worry about that. {w=0.5}Rey’s going with you."
    em "No te preocupes por eso. {w=0.5}Rey va contigo."

# game/Story02.rpy:3750

translate spanish akt2chapter6_ce321755:

    # aS "(You have to be kidding me…)"
    aS "(Tienes que estar bromeando...)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3752

translate spanish akt2chapter6_1a44efcc:

    # k "Tough luck, sweetheart. {w=0.5}You’re not getting rid of me that easily."
    k "Mala suerte, cariño. {w=0.5}No te estás deshaciendo de mí tan fácilmente."

# game/Story02.rpy:3754

translate spanish akt2chapter6_09ebd0e0:

    # Fl "As for you, Mi…"
    Fl "En cuanto a ti, Mi..."

# game/Story02.rpy:3755

translate spanish akt2chapter6_89509e8c:

    # Fl "No matter what it takes, you need to get the Lower City people on our side."
    Fl "No importa lo que sea necesario, necesitas conseguir a la gente de la Ciudad Baja de nuestro lado."

# game/Story02.rpy:3757

translate spanish akt2chapter6_6ff78fc1:

    # Fl "You’re the {b}only one{/b} they’ll listen to."
    Fl "Eres el {b}solo uno{/b} Ellos escucharán."

# game/Story02.rpy:3758

translate spanish akt2chapter6_41224a46:

    # Fl "So maybe it’s time you take a leap of faith… {w=0.5}and lead them?"
    Fl "Así que tal vez es hora de que tomes un salto de fe... {w=0.5}¿y los guiará?"

# game/Story02.rpy:3760

translate spanish akt2chapter6_da3fdbf1_3:

    # Mi "..."
    Mi "..."

# game/Story02.rpy:3762

translate spanish akt2chapter6_14dccb90:

    # Fl "Well, it’s your call. {w=0.5}That’s all for now."
    Fl "Bueno, es tu decisión. {w=0.5}Eso es todo por ahora."

# game/Story02.rpy:3766

translate spanish akt2chapter6_4f32b884:

    # em "Time for our star to start paying off her debts."
    em "Es hora de que nuestra estrella empiece a pagar sus deudas."

# game/Story02.rpy:3767

translate spanish akt2chapter6_5c4e4250:

    # em "We’re heading straight north."
    em "Nos dirigimos hacia el norte."

# game/Story02.rpy:3770

translate spanish akt2chapter6_aed6908b:

    # aS "Bye-bye, pretty boy, don’t miss me too much."
