    # "Flora's heart began to race, anticipation building as she waited to see what he'd do next."
    "El corazón de Flora empezó a acelerarse, y la expectativa crecía mientras esperaba ver qué haría él después."

# game/Story02.rpy:3887
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_5f3f16a6:

    # Fl "(I shouldn't provoke him...)"
    Fl "(No debería provocarlo...)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3888
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_18628ed8:

    # Fl "(But that voice...)"
    Fl "(Pero esa voz...)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3890
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_0de0ba8c:

    # Fl "(...why is that so unbelievably hot?)"
    Fl "(...¿por qué eso me excita tanto?)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3907
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_d4932bca:

    # Fl "(What am I even doing?)"
    Fl "(¿Qué estoy haciendo?)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3908
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_0d683b44:

    # Fl "(He didn't ask for this...)"
    Fl "(Él no pidió esto...)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3909
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_aad8ed7c:

    # Fl "(My hand just... moved on its own.)"
    Fl "(Mi mano simplemente... se movió sola.)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3910
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_0f9e3d03:

    # Fl "(No, no, no! He's going to think I'm some kind of pervert!)"
    Fl "(¡No, no, no! ¡Va a pensar que soy una pervertida!)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3911
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_f1a92ad8:

    # Fl "(Throwing myself at him the first chance I get...)"
    Fl "(Lanzándome sobre él a la primera oportunidad...)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3912
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_5221c37a:

    # mc "...Not bad."
    mc "...No está mal."

# game/Story02.rpy:3914
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_9c0136de:

    # "Your thoughts begin to drift, pulling you further away from the moment."
    "Tus pensamientos empiezan a divagar, alejándote cada vez más del momento."

# game/Story02.rpy:3915
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_73733df5:

    # mc "(I have a wife...)"
    mc "(Tengo esposa...)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3916
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_a7a3ffdc:

    # mc "(And I still went along with this.)"
    mc "(Y aun así seguí adelante con esto.)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3918
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_6f5b3e68:

    # mc "(That makes me a terrible man... {w}An even worse husband.)"
    mc "(Eso me convierte en un hombre horrible... {w}y en un esposo aún peor.)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3919
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_50c0e131:

    # "Noticing the distant look on [mc]'s face, Flora quickens her pace, as if desperate to draw his attention back to her."
    "Al notar la mirada ausente en el rostro de [mc], Flora acelera el ritmo, como desesperada por atraer de nuevo su atención hacia ella."

# game/Story02.rpy:3920
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_0d9bf3dc:

    # Fl "(Y-you idiot...)"
    Fl "(I-idiota...)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3921
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_163bfff4:

    # Fl "(How dare you make that face?)"
    Fl "(¿Cómo te atreves a poner esa cara?)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3922
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_4f258eba:

    # Fl "(...Don't tell me you're not enjoying this.)"
    Fl "(...No me digas que no estás disfrutando esto.)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3923
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_28cd26cc:

    # Fl "(I know I saw this work in those magazines...)"
    Fl "(Sé que vi que esto funcionaba en esas revistas...)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3924
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_a80701c1:

    # Fl "(Y-yeah... he's just pretending.)"
    Fl "(S-sí... solo está fingiendo.)"

# game/Story02.rpy:3925
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_f3c45bc6:

    # "Flora's soft moans slip out more and more often, each one harder to hold back than the last."
    "Los suaves gemidos de Flora se escapan cada vez con más frecuencia, cada uno más difícil de contener que el anterior."

# game/Story02.rpy:3926
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_1864b97f:

    # mc "Something bothering you? Your eyes keep darting around."
    mc "¿Te preocupa algo? No dejas de mover los ojos de un lado a otro."

# game/Story02.rpy:3927
translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_e1f49dc2:

    # Fl "...You don't exactly look like you're enjoying yourself."
    Fl "...No pareces estar disfrutándolo precisamente."

