translate spanish akt2chapter5_5_d0702e3d:

    # "The mere thought sends a wave of desire through her entire body, every part of her aching for [mc]."
    "El simple pensamiento envía una ola de deseo por todo su cuerpo, y cada parte de ella anhela a [mc]."

